                                "sense_id": "6455c76b-230d-3df6-9dbc-e2371d396375",
                                "text": "The land should, when procurable on such terms, be rented from the Zemindar, or the person to whom it has been let; and the rentee should engage to plough, and sow the land and reap the crop, […]"
